In this patch, the "finger of death" spell is changed such that,
instead of firing a death ray, it instead makes your next few melee
strikes instantly kill ("use the Touch of Death") those that it hits
(unless they are immune to death spells) - similar to the "confuse
monster" spell.

Casting it at expert proficiency gives you 2-4 uses. Casting it at
skilled proficiency gives you 2 uses. Casting it at lower proficiency,
or when you already have 'uses' to expend, gives you 1 (extra) use.

This patch also makes it easier to add more "touch" spells in the
future.

